  1 │ /**
  2 │  * Named worktrees: switch, list, remove, path (WP-1310).
  3 │  *
  4 │  * Git's worktree list is the truth about what exists; the registry (registry.ts) records what Nexus created. Nothing
  5 │  * here runs a hook, a project-supplied command or a shell. Every Git call goes through git.ts.
  6 │  */
